                                "sense_id": "6db8dacf-7b53-36f8-9653-7049c983ed98",
                                "text": "‘Why not let them out to roam and scratch and peck at insects and worms and see if they come home in the evening and peck each other? Why debeak hens for something you are doing wrong?’"
